# 4. REACT RULE

Gunakan React 18.

Gunakan functional components.

Contoh struktur:

```jsx
function App() {
  return (
    <div>
      <Header />
      <Main />
      <BottomNav />
    </div>
  );
}
```

Component dapat dibuat dalam file yang sama:

```jsx
function Header() {
  return (
    <header>
      ...
    </header>
  );
}

function Main() {
  return (
    <main>
      ...
    </main>
  );
}
```

Gunakan React Hooks jika diperlukan:

```jsx
const { useState, useEffect, useMemo, useRef } = React;
```

Jangan menggunakan:

```javascript
import React from "react";
import ReactDOM from "react-dom/client";
```

karena aplikasi berjalan melalui CDN global.

Gunakan:

```javascript
React
ReactDOM
```

atau destructuring:

```javascript
const {
  useState,
  useEffect,
  useMemo,
  useRef
} = React;
```

